### Get weight status by group (using query parameter)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/weights/status?group=mock/lsp

### Get weight status by provider id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/weights/provider/lsp-1

### Reset weights for specific group
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/weights/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "group": "mock/lsp"
}
